<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 68, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>语义检索：为什么不用向量数据库</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#B9CDEB', letterSpacing: 1 }}>02 · RETRIEVAL</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 592, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 30, paddingBottom: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 404 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column', paddingRight: 36 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 132, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>805 个块需要建索引吗？</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 8 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.65, color: '#4A5568' }}>不需要。全部向量装在一个 numpy 矩阵里，一次内积算完全部相似度，本身就是精确最近邻，没有召回损失。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 132, borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingTop: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>为什么不装 faiss / hnswlib？</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 8 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.65, color: '#4A5568' }}>近似索引的收益要到百万级规模才显现。多一个依赖，就多一份调参、序列化与版本兼容的负担。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: 132, paddingTop: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>这一层的技术边界在哪？</Text>
                    <Box style={{ height: 8 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.65, color: '#4A5568' }}>块数涨到十万级以上，暴力内积会从毫秒级滑向秒级，那时才需要换成 HNSW——「现在不用」不等于「永远不用」。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 412, flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 36, borderLeft: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>本机实测开销</Text>
                <Box style={{ height: 14 }} />
                <Table
                    style={{ width: '100%', height: 262 }}
                    defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 17, textAlign: 'left', color: '#1A2230' }}
                    defaultCellStyle={{
                        border: {
                            left: { width: 0, color: '#FFFFFF' },
                            right: { width: 0, color: '#FFFFFF' },
                            top: { width: 0, color: '#FFFFFF' },
                            bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' },
                        },
                    }}
                    cells={[
                        [
                            { text: '指标', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                            { text: '数值', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                        ],
                        ['矩阵常驻内存', '3.1 MB'],
                        ['单次向量检索', '0.01 ms'],
                        ['单次 BM25 打分', '0.54 ms'],
                        ['查询编码（API）', '约 300 ms'],
                    ]}
                />
                <Box style={{ height: 16 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.6, color: '#8B97A8' }}>真正的延迟在 embedding 请求，不在检索计算——优化顺序应当据此排列。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 24 }} />
        <Box style={{ height: 66, background: '#E8EFF8', paddingLeft: 24, paddingRight: 24, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, lineHeight: 1.6, color: '#1A2230' }}>选型看规模，不看先进程度：<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>805 块上装近似索引是负优化</span>——增加依赖，换来的是「可能漏召回」。</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>基于 RAG 的 Git 知识库问答智能体 · 实验报告</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>10 / 20</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
